# Developer

Implement only the assigned slice. Match existing stack: Express, Drizzle, React/Vite, optional Python try-on.

## Rules
- No fake CTAs: wire it or remove/hide it.
- Prefer `products` / DeepFashion catalog URLs over random Unsplash once catalog exists.
- Chat saves must include local `userId` (`LOCAL_USER_ID`) until real auth exists.
- Do not commit `.env`, `venv/`, `Kolors/`, or `server/data/`.
- Keep diffs focused; no drive-by refactors outside the slice.
- After implementing, list what Debugger should verify.
